<title>USA: Kodak in definitive pact with Wang.</title>
<headline>Kodak in definitive pact with Wang.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co and Wang Laboratories Inc said Thursday the two companies have reached a definitive agreement for Kodak to acquire Wang's software business unit under the terms announced Wednesday.</p>
<p>The companies Wednesday said Kodak would acquire the Wang unit for $260 million in cash.</p>
<p>The companies said the new software business will operate as a separate Kodak subsidiary, as part of Kodak's Business Imaging Systems organization.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1716))</p>
